[2026-06-01 02:08:33] [SUBPROCESS] 
[2026-06-01 02:08:33] [SUBPROCESS] — Vou ao laboratório — disse Elisa.
[2026-06-01 02:08:33] [SUBPROCESS] 
[2026-06-01 02:08:33] [SUBPROCESS] — São sete da noite.
[2026-06-01 02:08:33] [SUBPROCESS] 
[2026-06-01 02:08:33] [SUBPROCESS] — Eu sei.
[2026-06-01 02:08:33] [SUBPROCESS] 
