[2026-06-01 02:36:55] [SUBPROCESS] 
[2026-06-01 02:36:55] [SUBPROCESS] O formalismo era completo. O formalismo era correcto. O formalismo era insuficiente.
[2026-06-01 02:36:55] [SUBPROCESS] 
